{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02399","headline":"杂歌谣辞 步虚引 · 陈陶","name":"杂歌谣辞 步虚引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小隐山人十洲客，莓苔爲衣双耳白。\n青编爲我忽降书，暮雨虹蜺一千尺。\n赤城门闭六丁直，晓日已烧东海色。\n朝天半夜闻玉鸡，星斗离离碍龙翼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}